@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing questions are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`. A message containing the exact lowercase substring `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message passed to the classifier is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+These values label a support request. They do not approve a refund, determine whether an invoice is correct, or perform a billing action. Support responses must remain grounded in available project evidence and identify missing information instead of inventing an outcome.

